flowchart TB
  Key[API key] --> Tenant[tenant_id]
  Tenant --> WebTargets[tenant_web_targets]
  Tenant --> AzureScopes[tenant_azure_scopes]
  Tenant --> Scans[scans]
  Scans --> Results[scan_results]
  Scans --> Attempts[scan_attempts]
  Tenant --> Billing[billing ledger/snapshots]
  Tenant --> Session[Service Bus sessionId=tenantId]
  ScopesCheck{Scope autorise?}
  WebTargets --> ScopesCheck
  AzureScopes --> ScopesCheck
  ScopesCheck -- non --> Reject[Reject 400/403]
  ScopesCheck -- oui --> Quota[Quota + active scan limit]
  Quota -- bloque --> Backpressure[TENANT_ACTIVE_SCAN_LIMIT_REACHED]
  Quota -- ok --> Enqueue[Queue session tenant]
  Enqueue --> Worker[Worker idempotent]
  Worker --> Results
